@startuml
' Shared look for every diagram: plain black-and-white UML, course style.
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #000000
  HeaderBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #000000
}
skinparam actorBorderColor #000000
skinparam actorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #000000
skinparam packageBorderColor #000000
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodeBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam artifactBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam stateBorderColor #000000
skinparam objectBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam objectBorderColor #000000
skinparam entityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam boundaryBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam controlBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFF0
skinparam noteBorderColor #888888
skinparam titleFontSize 14
hide empty members
hide circle
left to right direction
title Q3a – Biểu đồ giao tiếp – kịch bản chuẩn Approve and Export Order 0 (51 bước)

actor "Nhân viên bán hàng" as Actor
boundary SaleHomeView
boundary OrderListView
boundary OrderDetailView
boundary DeliveryStaffListView
boundary InvoicePrintView
entity Order
entity OrderDetail
entity DeliveryStaff
entity Product
entity Invoice

Actor -- SaleHomeView : 1: click subBrowseOrder >
SaleHomeView -- OrderListView : 2: gọi >
Actor -- OrderListView : 3: chọn "Chưa xuất" + click subFilter\n8: click đơn DH1024 >
OrderListView -- Order : 4: gọi >
Order -- Order : "5: listUnexported()\n16: approve()\n27: assignDelivery()\n38: export()"
Order -- OrderListView : 6: trả về >
OrderListView -- Actor : 7: hiển thị >
OrderListView -- OrderDetailView : 9: gọi >
OrderDetailView -- OrderDetail : 10: gọi >
OrderDetail -- OrderDetail : "11: listByOrder()"
OrderDetail -- OrderDetailView : 12: trả về >
OrderDetailView -- Actor : 13: hiển thị\n18: hiển thị\n43: hiển thị thông báo xuất thành công >
Actor -- OrderDetailView : 14: click subApprove\n19: click subAssignDelivery\n30: click subExport\n44: click subPrintInvoice >
OrderDetailView -- Order : 15: gọi\n37: gọi >
Order -- OrderDetailView : 17: trả về\n39: trả về >
OrderDetailView -- DeliveryStaffListView : 20: gọi >
DeliveryStaffListView -- DeliveryStaff : 21: gọi >
DeliveryStaff -- DeliveryStaff : "22: listAvailable()"
DeliveryStaff -- DeliveryStaffListView : 23: trả về >
DeliveryStaffListView -- Actor : 24: hiển thị\n29: hiển thị >
Actor -- DeliveryStaffListView : 25: chọn GH03 + click subSaveAssign >
DeliveryStaffListView -- Order : 26: gọi >
Order -- DeliveryStaffListView : 28: trả về >
OrderDetailView -- Product : 31: gọi\n34: gọi >
Product -- Product : "32: checkStock()\n35: decreaseStock()"
Product -- OrderDetailView : 33: trả về\n36: trả về >
OrderDetailView -- Invoice : 40: gọi >
Invoice -- Invoice : "41: issue()\n47: getInvoiceDetail()"
Invoice -- OrderDetailView : 42: trả về >
OrderDetailView -- InvoicePrintView : 45: gọi >
InvoicePrintView -- Invoice : 46: gọi >
Invoice -- InvoicePrintView : 48: trả về >
InvoicePrintView -- Actor : 49: hiển thị\n51: hiển thị >
Actor -- InvoicePrintView : 50: click subPrint >
@enduml
